description=Container sorting, supply planning and a versioned supply API for separate mods. Requires B47ANCEDRooms (Workshop item 3820077442) for room designation and delegated room policies. Both area scopes include full carried inventory and configured physical storage. Permissions are enforced at supported server integration checks, not unrelated vanilla actions. Obsolete B47 sorting formats/category rules are removed on authority; native rules, item selections, priorities and owned presets are retained. Back up saves before upgrading. Vanilla categories when used alone. Optional Better Sorting (BetterSortCC) and Better Containers (EURY_CONTAINERS / REORDER_CONTAINERS) integrations use native categories; Better Containers category selections save explicit item choices. Disable original Quartermaster (Quartermaster) and older B47 sorting copies. Experimental MP testing build - dedicated multiplayer NOT TESTED; optional-mod runtime acceptance and Sort startup delay investigation remain pending.
